<title>PHILIPPINES: ABS-CBN says 9-mth net up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>ABS-CBN says 9-mth net up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in billion pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   1.40 vs 1.20</p>
<p>    Gross Revenues		   3.25 vs 2.79</p>
<p>    Net income			 1.09 vs 0.9317</p>
<p>Note: Full name ABS-CBN Broadcasting Corp.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
